      "date": "2026-02-16T08:39:07.000Z",
      "title": "Price target increased by 14% to ₹1,644",
      "body": "Up from ₹1,445, the current price target is an average from 5 analysts. New target price is approximately in line with last closing price of ₹1,624. Stock is up 201% over the past year. The company is forecast to post earnings per share of ₹39.73 for next year compared to ₹26.08 last year.",
